00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:09.053
I mean, this poor crew, and show them,

00:03:09.053 --> 00:03:11.118
because I wanna show how poor the crew is,

00:03:11.118 --> 00:03:12.838
and I don't mean financially, I mean,

00:03:12.838 --> 00:03:14.976
how I feel bad for them
